('00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000c0001', '273323b0194e7d64-1', '273323b0194e7d64', '7348b80f5bc621d8', 1, '43', 44, 'Road Dismantling', '["Dismantling of flexible pavement for pipe line and chambers by mechanical means using pneumatic tools, breaking to pieces not exceeding 0.02 cum in volume and stock piling at designated locations and disposal of dismantled materials up to a lead of 1000 meters. Measurement for dismantled trench to be made as per standard trench width specified in tender document and no extra payment shall be made be made for trench width more than specified, re-handling of material/earth to complete the tasks per technical specification and scope of work."]'::jsonb, 'Bituminous courses', 'Cum', 'cum', 416, null, 280, null, null, 'FIXED', null, true),
